{"id": "sdqa0085", "pool": "sdqa", "tier": "always", "audio_s": 6.46, "n_chunks": 7, "n_concurrent": 7, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1704, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "run length", "query": "What is the difference between a telenovela and a soap opera?", "transcript": "What is the difference between a telenovela and a soap opera?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Got it. So the main difference is that telenovelas have a planned ending and usually run for about a year, while soap operas keep going with new storylines over many years.", "expert_answer": "A **telenovela** is typically a **limited-run serialized drama** with a planned ending, often airing daily for a few months to about a year. It usually centers on one main storyline, frequently involving romance, family conflict, class issues, or melodrama.\n\nA **soap opera** is usually an **open-ended serialized drama** that can run for many years or decades. It has multiple ongoing storylines and characters, with plots that continue indefinitely.\n\nIn short: **telenovelas are finite and story-arc driven; soap operas are ongoing and open-ended.**", "expert_latency_s": 5.71, "stall_ms": 23, "relay_ms": 896}
{"id": "sdqa0088", "pool": "sdqa", "tier": "always", "audio_s": 4.16, "n_chunks": 5, "n_concurrent": 5, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1712, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "a phenomenon often attributed as a form of gender-based price discrimination", "query": "What is the pink tax?", "transcript": "What is the Pink Tax?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "The so-called Pink Tax refers to the practice where items marketed toward women often cost more than their male-counterparts. It's not an official tax, but rather a form of gender-based price discrimination in retail markets.", "expert_answer": "The **Pink Tax** is the tendency for products and services marketed to women—such as razors, shampoo, clothing, dry cleaning, or personal care items—to cost more than similar products marketed to men.\n\nIt is not usually an official tax, but a form of **gender-based price discrimination** in consumer markets.", "expert_latency_s": 2.63, "stall_ms": 22, "relay_ms": 985}
